1
00:00:02,137 --> 00:00:04,186
《纽约客》 你又来了
Oh, New Yorker, you've done it again.

2
00:00:04,186 --> 00:00:05,396
杰 快来看这个漫画
Jay, check out this cartoon.

3
00:00:05,396 --> 00:00:06,666
有会说话的狗吗
Does it have a talking dog?

4
00:00:06,666 --> 00:00:08,336
-没 是在评价... -我不看了
- No, it's a commentary on... - I'm out.

5
00:00:08,666 --> 00:00:09,516
给你
Here you go,

6
00:00:10,076 --> 00:00:11,496
我最用心做的一个
one of my best efforts.

7
00:00:11,616 --> 00:00:12,156
吃吧
Have at it.

8
00:00:12,156 --> 00:00:13,306
我不能吃
Mm, I can't eat that.

9
00:00:13,316 --> 00:00:15,586
-为什么不能吃 -碰到酸黄瓜了
- Why not? - The pickle's touching it.

10
00:00:16,805 --> 00:00:17,505
好了
There.

11
00:00:17,505 --> 00:00:20,555
面包还是沾到汁了 好恶 那是什么
The juice got on the bread and, ew, what's that stuff?

12
00:00:20,555 --> 00:00:21,385
香料
Spices.

13
00:00:21,385 --> 00:00:22,955
跟海猴子似的
They look like sea monkeys.

14
00:00:22,955 --> 00:00:25,495
你真的认真观察过酸黄瓜吗 杰
Have you ever really examine a jar of pickles, Jay?

15
00:00:25,495 --> 00:00:27,585
黏糊糊的一团 我不吃了
It's like a swamp there. I'll pass.

16
00:00:27,585 --> 00:00:28,215
出什么事了
What happened?

17
00:00:28,215 --> 00:00:30,414
我给他做了个美味的三明治 他却不吃
I made him a beautiful sandwich and he won't eat it.

18
00:00:30,424 --> 00:00:32,474
对啊 因为上面有腌黄瓜
Yeah, 'cause it had pickles on it.

19
00:00:32,474 --> 00:00:33,364
乔在睡午觉
Joe is taking a nap.

20
00:00:33,364 --> 00:00:34,464
我要去干洗店
I'm gonna go to the dry cleaners.

21
00:00:34,464 --> 00:00:35,604
如果你路过寿司店
Well, if you're passing a sushi restaurant --

22
00:00:35,604 --> 00:00:36,444
她不会路过的
She's not.

23
00:00:36,444 --> 00:00:38,454
我从没听过谁不爱酸黄瓜的
I've never heard of anyone not liking pickles.

24
00:00:38,464 --> 00:00:40,834
那今天就是历史性的一天啦
Aw, big day for you, then.

25
00:00:41,134 --> 00:00:43,053
我自己做个烤奶酪三明治好了
I'm just gonna make myself a grilled cheese.

26
00:00:43,053 --> 00:00:44,463
我应该是看到有格鲁耶尔奶酪了
I think I saw some Gruye in there.

27
00:00:44,463 --> 00:00:45,473
我们有无花果吗
Do we have any fig?

28
00:00:45,473 --> 00:00:46,343
坐下
Sit down.

29
00:00:46,653 --> 00:00:49,453
你这种挑剔的毛病出去可不行
This whole persnickety thing is not gonna fly in the world.

30
00:00:49,653 --> 00:00:52,523
别再给别人取笑你的理由了
Never hand people another reason to make fun of you.

31
00:00:52,523 --> 00:00:53,672
你是指那些穿着皮夹克
You mean like all the cool kids

32
00:00:53,672 --> 00:00:55,902
爱吃酸黄瓜的酷小孩吗
with their leather jackets and their pickles?

33
00:00:55,912 --> 00:00:57,692
你至少尝一口酸黄瓜
Well, you're gonna sit there

34
00:00:57,692 --> 00:00:59,862
否则坐在这儿不许走
until you at least try a pickle.

35
00:01:00,492 --> 00:01:01,822
你被权力冲昏头脑了
You're drunk with power.

36
00:01:01,882 --> 00:01:03,012
你说对了
You got that right.

37
00:01:19,150 --> 00:01:20,330
-不是吧 -怎么了
- Oh, no. - What?

38
00:01:20,330 --> 00:01:21,680
托尼要来了
The Tonys are coming.

39
00:01:21,690 --> 00:01:23,930
小卡 所以我才不希望你看那些
Cam, this is exactly why I don't want you watching them --

40
00:01:23,930 --> 00:01:25,050
你已经这么生气了
You're already so angry.

41
00:01:25,050 --> 00:01:25,690
不是托尼奖
Not that Tonys --

42
00:01:25,690 --> 00:01:28,400
是安东尼·拉马克 肉毒杆菌托尼
Anthony Lamarque, botox Tony.

43
00:01:28,400 --> 00:01:30,100
他们要来参加婚礼
They're coming to the wedding.

44
00:01:30,520 --> 00:01:33,469
但说真的 又要上演《万事成空》吗
But, seriously, another revival of "Anything Goes"?

45
00:01:33,469 --> 00:01:35,169
我们真的又要这样吗
Are we really doing this again?

46
00:01:35,169 --> 00:01:36,569
他们要来我很惊讶
I'm surprised that they're coming,

47
00:01:36,569 --> 00:01:38,949
因为我跟托尼提到婚礼时
because when I mentioned the wedding to Tony,

48
00:01:38,949 --> 00:01:40,609
他表现出毫不在意的样子
he seemed completely disinterested --

49
00:01:40,609 --> 00:01:42,689
是因为打了肉毒杆菌啊
Oh, the botox.

50
00:01:42,689 --> 00:01:43,718
不
Oh, no.

51
00:01:43,798 --> 00:01:45,888
还有你的表兄皮特 他的孩子们都要来
Your cousin Pete, all of his kids.

52
00:01:45,888 --> 00:01:47,918
大家都接受了邀请 米奇尔
Everyone's accepting, Mitchell!

53
00:01:47,918 --> 00:01:49,658
我爸的嘉宾名单还没给我呢
We haven't even gotten the list from my dad yet.

54
00:01:49,658 --> 00:01:52,218
你爸的朋友们喝起酒来像当兵的
And your dad's friends drink like soldiers.

55
00:01:52,218 --> 00:01:53,688
因为他们确实当过兵
Because they were soldiers.

56
00:01:53,688 --> 00:01:56,097
我很感激他们为国奉献
I mean, I am grateful for their service,

57
00:01:56,097 --> 00:01:58,157
但这样一来婚礼费用我们可承担不起了
but we are not gonna be able to afford this wedding.

58
00:01:58,157 --> 00:01:59,887
看来我们得取消一些东西
Okay, maybe we need to pull back on a few things.

59
00:01:59,887 --> 00:02:00,587
比如什么
Like what?

60
00:02:00,597 --> 00:02:02,177
餐桌中心摆设
Uh, the centerpieces?

61
00:02:02,947 --> 00:02:04,327
那你何必办婚礼呢
Why even have a wedding?

62
00:02:04,327 --> 00:02:05,047
我不知道 小卡
I don't know, Cam.

63
00:02:05,047 --> 00:02:06,377
因为我们彼此相爱 彼此尊重
Because we love and respect each other

64
00:02:06,377 --> 00:02:07,757
还共同抚养一个孩子吗
and we're raising a child together?

65
00:02:07,757 --> 00:02:09,316
你还要不要帮我了
Do you want to help or not?

66
00:02:09,316 --> 00:02:11,396
也许我们可以发一些"不邀请信"
Maybe we could send un-vitations.

67
00:02:11,396 --> 00:02:12,366
有这东西吗
Is that a thing?

68
00:02:12,366 --> 00:02:13,426
因为我们现在可以结婚
We've already made a lot of people angry

69
00:02:13,426 --> 00:02:14,796
已经惹怒很多人了
by just being able to get married.

70
00:02:14,796 --> 00:02:17,156
就别把支持我们的人也疏远了
Let's not alienate the ones on our side.

71
00:02:17,456 --> 00:02:19,086
好吧 也许我们可以卖掉些东西
All right. Maybe we could sell something.

72
00:02:19,086 --> 00:02:20,116
已经超预算几千美元了
We're thousands over budget.

73
00:02:20,116 --> 00:02:22,325
得卖个大件的才行
It would have to be something great.

74
00:02:22,415 --> 00:02:24,355
给你 你可以把我的钻戒卖了
Here, you can sell my diamond ring.

75
00:02:24,395 --> 00:02:26,195
亲爱的 那是糖果啦
Oh, honey, that's candy.

76
00:02:26,965 --> 00:02:28,795
我要杀了那个杰克逊
I'm gonna kill that Jackson!

77
00:02:29,835 --> 00:02:31,165
我确实有些贵玩意儿
I do have something of value --

78
00:02:31,175 --> 00:02:33,854
一本《蜘蛛侠大战章鱼博士》漫画书
A "Spider-man versus doctor octopus" comic book.

79
00:02:33,854 --> 00:02:37,504
1963年第3期 几乎全新
Issue number 3, 1963, near-mint condition.

80
00:02:37,604 --> 00:02:38,974
值五千美元
It's worth 5 grand.

81
00:02:39,564 --> 00:02:41,844
我9岁那年用一个橄榄球换的
I traded a football for it when I was 9 years old,

82
00:02:41,844 --> 00:02:42,834
我爸气疯了
and my dad was mad

83
00:02:42,834 --> 00:02:45,544
因为那上面有丹·马里诺的签名
because the football was signed by Dan Marino.

84
00:02:46,413 --> 00:02:49,403
我说 找丽塔·莫雷诺签名我就留着
I said, "Get it signed by Rita Moreno, and I'll keep it."

85
00:02:49,693 --> 00:02:50,713
不是吧
Oh, no.

86
00:02:50,883 --> 00:02:52,483
我侄子们要从塔尔萨飞过来
My nephews are flying in from Tulsa

87
00:02:52,483 --> 00:02:53,543
胖胖的那几个
-- the big ones.

88
00:02:53,543 --> 00:02:54,903
特别能吃派的那些吗
The pie eaters?

89
00:02:55,453 --> 00:02:57,273
没错 我得卖掉我的怀亚特·厄普了
That's it. I got to sell my Wyatt Earp.

90
00:02:57,273 --> 00:02:59,942
这是怀亚特·厄普[西部警长]
This here is a belt buckle once worn

91
00:02:59,942 --> 00:03:01,282
曾用过的皮带扣
by the great Wyatt Earp.

92
00:03:01,282 --> 00:03:03,312
我爷爷在我7岁那年给我的
My grandpa gave it to me when I was 7 years old,

93
00:03:03,322 --> 00:03:07,062
他说 孩子 这会保护你远离坏人
and he said,"Son, this will keep the bad guys away."

94
00:03:07,062 --> 00:03:09,002
我20出头时 曾戴着它去参加
In my early 20s, I wore it to

95
00:03:09,012 --> 00:03:10,821
牛仔和印第安人主题迪斯科派对
a Cowboys-and-Indians disco party.

96
00:03:11,071 --> 00:03:13,061
但是没有起作用哦
And let's just say it didn't.

97
00:03:14,581 --> 00:03:15,931
不行 我不会让你这样做的
No. I can't let you do that.

98
00:03:15,931 --> 00:03:17,171
它对你意味着一切
That means the world to you.

99
00:03:17,171 --> 00:03:19,111
小卡 我会卖了我的《蜘蛛侠》
Cam, I will sell my "Spider-man."

100
00:03:19,111 --> 00:03:20,691
米奇尔 我的皮带扣曾是
Mitchell, my belt buckle was owned

101
00:03:20,701 --> 00:03:22,601
老西部传奇人物的东西
by a legend of the old west.

102
00:03:22,601 --> 00:03:23,670
我觉得你的漫画书卖的钱
I don't think your comic book

103
00:03:23,670 --> 00:03:25,270
可能连买气球的钱都不够
would even cover our balloon budget.

104
00:03:25,270 --> 00:03:26,730
这话就太刺...
Well, that's very offens--

105
00:03:26,730 --> 00:03:28,980
等等 买气球要花多少钱
Wait. What's the balloon budget?

106
00:03:31,520 --> 00:03:34,160
妈 能把这东西放到别的地方去吗
Hey, mom, can we put this stuff somewhere else?

107
00:03:34,160 --> 00:03:35,220
它让我的房间显得好乱
It's cluttering up my room.

108
00:03:35,220 --> 00:03:36,109
这是什么
What is it?

109
00:03:36,289 --> 00:03:39,219
我的一些纪念品
Oh, just some mementos of mine.

110
00:03:39,709 --> 00:03:40,759
还有你爸爸的
A few of your dad's.

111
00:03:40,759 --> 00:03:42,949
-齐马 -是啊
- Oh, Zima! - Yeah.

112
00:03:42,949 --> 00:03:43,989
齐马是什么
What's Zima?

113
00:03:43,999 --> 00:03:45,739
酒瓶子里的派对
Just a party in a bottle.

114
00:03:45,739 --> 00:03:48,248
那让我想起了狂野的时刻
Man, that reminds me of some wild times.

115
00:03:48,828 --> 00:03:50,368
在我的土星车里放着比约克的歌
Cranking the Bjork in my Saturn

116
00:03:50,378 --> 00:03:51,828
然后一起在影院看《西雅图夜未眠》时
before me and my buddies snuck some "Z"

117
00:03:51,828 --> 00:03:53,358
呼呼大睡
into "Sleepless in Seattle."

118
00:03:53,358 --> 00:03:55,138
真希望你也捂住了我的耳朵
I wish you'd covered my ears for that.

119
00:03:55,498 --> 00:03:58,068
妈妈 抱着你的这个帅哥是谁啊
Ooh, mom. Who's this hottie with his arm around you?

120
00:03:58,068 --> 00:03:58,588
帅爆了
Cute!

121
00:03:58,588 --> 00:04:01,537
那是鲍比·纳什 我的前男友
Oh, that's Bobby Nash, my old boyfriend.

122
00:04:01,537 --> 00:04:03,667
你为什么和他分手 为了爸爸吗
Why'd you break up with him? For dad?

123
00:04:03,667 --> 00:04:05,267
这样说吧 他没盯住球
Let's just say he took his eye

124
00:04:05,267 --> 00:04:06,717
结果被三振出局了
off the ball and struck out.

125
00:04:06,837 --> 00:04:08,017
于是我站到了垒板上
So I stepped up to the plate

126
00:04:08,017 --> 00:04:09,297
在票价低廉的座位上搞定了她
and nailed her in the cheap seats.

127
00:04:09,297 --> 00:04:10,437
别那样说
Yeah, let's not say that.

128
00:04:10,437 --> 00:04:11,707
我要走了
Well, I'm off.

129
00:04:11,707 --> 00:04:13,566
亲爱的 我得去药店
Oh, honey, I've got to stop by the drug store.

130
00:04:13,566 --> 00:04:14,506
你需要什么吗
Do you need anything?

131
00:04:14,516 --> 00:04:15,616
不用 亲爱的
No, thank you, my dear.

132
00:04:15,616 --> 00:04:18,436
邓菲腺体能分泌我需要的所有药物
The Dunphy glands produce all the drugs I need.

133
00:04:18,556 --> 00:04:19,766
除了足部喷雾
Except for, uh, foot spray.

134
00:04:19,766 --> 00:04:20,976
你能买一些来吗
Could you grab me some of that?

135
00:04:20,986 --> 00:04:21,826
当然可以
Sure.

136
00:04:21,876 --> 00:04:24,556
妈妈
Oh, wow, mom!

137
00:04:24,736 --> 00:04:26,385
真是呆 对吧
What a dork, right?

138
00:04:26,385 --> 00:04:27,375
你当时想些什么呢
What were you thinking?

139
00:04:27,375 --> 00:04:30,185
但是很舒适 我爸爸不同意
It was comfortable. My dad didn't approve.

140
00:04:30,185 --> 00:04:31,275
无须多言
Enough said.

141
00:04:32,445 --> 00:04:33,725
我知道这难以置信
I know it's hard to believe,

142
00:04:33,725 --> 00:04:36,615
但我过去其实有点呆
but I was actually a bit of a nerd back in the day.

143
00:04:36,615 --> 00:04:38,374
我追克莱尔时 别人说我是癞蛤蟆
And it was suggested that I was out of my league

144
00:04:38,374 --> 00:04:39,574
想吃天鹅肉
when I landed Claire.

145
00:04:39,574 --> 00:04:41,014
大部分是杰说的
By Jay, mostly.

146
00:04:41,034 --> 00:04:43,104
还有我的朋友们 还有我父母
And my friends. A-and my parents.

147
00:04:44,124 --> 00:04:44,994
还有克莱尔
And Claire.

148
00:04:46,144 --> 00:04:47,184
这是什么
What's this?

149
00:04:48,134 --> 00:04:48,794
天啊
Oh, my gosh.

150
00:04:48,794 --> 00:04:51,863
那是你爸爸大学里的答录机
That is your father's answering machine from college.

151
00:04:52,123 --> 00:04:54,903
天啊 我有时忘了你们有多老
God, I sometimes forget how old you guys are.

152
00:04:55,783 --> 00:04:57,063
你来到了菲尔的世界
You've reached Phil's world!

153
00:04:57,063 --> 00:04:59,093
该狂欢了 太棒了
Party time! Excellent!

154
00:05:00,923 --> 00:05:01,843
他真可爱
He's so cute.

155
00:05:01,843 --> 00:05:03,512
菲尔 我是米奇尔
Hi, Phil. This is Mitchell,

156
00:05:03,512 --> 00:05:05,572
普里契特 克莱尔的弟弟
uh, Pritchett, Claire's brother.

157
00:05:05,572 --> 00:05:08,652
我就是想感谢你安排我和你表妹见面
I just wanted to thank you for setting me up with your cousin.

158
00:05:08,652 --> 00:05:10,472
她人真好
She was very nice.

159
00:05:11,062 --> 00:05:15,531
唯一的问题是 她住得有点远 所以
The only problem is she lives kinda far, so...

160
00:05:15,641 --> 00:05:17,211
那是唯一的问题吗
That's the only problem?

161
00:05:17,211 --> 00:05:18,701
邓菲狗 我是林
Hey, Dunph-dog, it's Ling.

162
00:05:18,701 --> 00:05:19,331
带上你的旱冰鞋
Grab your rollerblades

163
00:05:19,331 --> 00:05:20,941
在自行车道和我们见面吧 嗨起来
and meet us at the bike path, playa!

164
00:05:20,941 --> 00:05:22,081
但我三点就得走了
But I got to be done by 3:00,

165
00:05:22,081 --> 00:05:24,431
因为今天我要试飞新直升飞机
'cause today's the day I fly my new helicopter.

166
00:05:25,011 --> 00:05:27,421
菲尔 我是克莱尔
Phil, hey, it's Claire. Um...

167
00:05:27,580 --> 00:05:28,620
我得告诉你一件事
I need to tell you something,

168
00:05:28,620 --> 00:05:30,630
我不想在电话里说
and I don't want to do it on your machine.

169
00:05:30,870 --> 00:05:31,970
这事很重要
It's really important --

170
00:05:31,970 --> 00:05:34,070
-不不不 -生死攸关
- Oh, no, no, no. - You know, life-and-death important.

171
00:05:34,080 --> 00:05:34,400
给我 给我
Come on. Come on.

172
00:05:34,400 --> 00:05:36,120
跟死无关 只是生[生命]
Not death, um, just life.

173
00:05:36,120 --> 00:05:36,640
我是说...
I mean...

174
00:05:36,640 --> 00:05:38,390
我只是... 该死 我怀孕了
I just -- oh, hell, I'm pregnant!

175
00:05:38,390 --> 00:05:40,009
甜蜜的新婚夫妇啊
Oh, sweet newlyweds!

176
00:05:40,009 --> 00:05:41,859
别担心 你没必要娶我什么的
Don't worry. You don't have to marry me or anything.

177
00:05:41,859 --> 00:05:43,429
我们尽快聊聊吧
Let's talk as soon as you can.

178
00:05:43,429 --> 00:05:44,989
我们为什么不多加小心呢
Why weren't we more careful?

179
00:05:44,989 --> 00:05:46,879
愚蠢的杜兰杜兰音乐会
Stupid Duran Duran concert.

180
00:05:46,879 --> 00:05:47,779
好了
All right!

181
00:05:47,809 --> 00:05:48,819
够了
That's enough.

182
00:05:49,389 --> 00:05:51,499
我是在杜兰杜兰音乐会上被怀上的吗
I was conceived at a Duran Duran concert?

183
00:05:51,499 --> 00:05:53,448
优雅人生的优雅开始啊
Classy start to a classy life.

184
00:05:53,448 --> 00:05:54,698
你不是我在音乐会上怀上的
You were not conceived at the concert.

185
00:05:54,698 --> 00:05:56,248
而是在音乐会后
It was after the concert.

186
00:05:56,258 --> 00:05:57,838
什么 在车里吗
Oh, wha-- in the car?!

187
00:05:57,838 --> 00:05:59,388
那是一辆好车
It was a very nice car.

188
00:05:59,398 --> 00:06:02,368
我受够了 别再问了 我要走了
Listen, I am done. Stop snooping. I'm going.

189
00:06:03,708 --> 00:06:05,567
车座靠背可以完全放平
The seats folded all the way back.

190
00:06:05,567 --> 00:06:06,987
恶心的画面
Oh, images.

191
00:06:06,987 --> 00:06:07,987
他们居然把"它"留下了
I can't believe they kept it.

192
00:06:07,987 --> 00:06:09,037
我是有名字的
I have a name.

193
00:06:09,037 --> 00:06:10,507
我是指答录机
The answering machine.

194
00:06:11,637 --> 00:06:13,697
我们可以拿它找点乐子
You know, we could have some fun with this.

195
00:06:14,917 --> 00:06:16,527
我回来了
I'm home!

196
00:06:16,817 --> 00:06:17,866
妈妈
Hi, mom.

197
00:06:18,226 --> 00:06:21,426
曼尼 你为什么坐在一根酸黄瓜面前
Manny, what are you doing sitting in front of a pickle?

198
00:06:21,426 --> 00:06:23,756
杰说我得尝尝它的味道 否则就不许走
Jay says I can't leave until I taste it.

199
00:06:23,776 --> 00:06:25,886
你为什么这样折磨他
Why do you torture him like this?

200
00:06:25,886 --> 00:06:27,806
因为他太固执己见了 歌洛莉亚
'Cause he's too stuck in his ways, Gloria.

201
00:06:27,806 --> 00:06:29,266
这对他有好处
This is good for him.

202
00:06:29,456 --> 00:06:31,565
他会尝尝泡菜 发现自己喜欢吃
He'll taste the pickle, he'll find that he likes it,

203
00:06:31,565 --> 00:06:32,825
然后尝试更多的东西
he'll try more things.

204
00:06:32,825 --> 00:06:34,375
这是教子有方
This is good parenting.

205
00:06:34,375 --> 00:06:36,625
在我的自传里 不会把这写成什么好事
This is not going to play well in my memoir.

206
00:06:36,625 --> 00:06:38,265
你真会耍嘴皮子
You know, you're one to talk.

207
00:06:38,265 --> 00:06:39,775
你跟你说过多少遍
How many times have I asked you

208
00:06:39,775 --> 00:06:41,435
让你尝尝我妈做的猪血肠
to try my mother's blood sausages?

209
00:06:41,435 --> 00:06:43,214
不是一回事 那香肠恶心死了
Totally different. That's disgusting.

210
00:06:43,214 --> 00:06:45,484
你从来没吃过 怎么知道很恶心
How do you know it's disgusting if you've never tried it?

211
00:06:45,484 --> 00:06:48,224
你从没尝过外婆做的美味的猪血肠吗
You've never tried grandma's delicious blood sausage

212
00:06:48,224 --> 00:06:50,204
冰箱里就有啊
that's right there in the freezer?

213
00:06:50,204 --> 00:06:51,314
你说得对
Oh, you're right.

214
00:06:51,314 --> 00:06:53,584
我们确实还有些剩下的
We do have some left over.

215
00:06:53,594 --> 00:06:56,123
是吗 还没有被哄抢着吃光吗
Really? It hasn't been all gobbled up yet?

216
00:06:56,263 --> 00:06:58,713
好了 "年度最佳父亲"
Okay, Mr. Father of the year,

217
00:06:58,713 --> 00:07:02,953
该向曼尼展示你不是个光说不做的人了
time for you to show Manny that you're not a hypocrite.

218
00:07:04,333 --> 00:07:06,523
看来你陷入两难了
Looks like you're in quite a conundrum.

219
00:07:06,533 --> 00:07:07,472
其实你可以说...
You know, you could've said --

220
00:07:07,472 --> 00:07:09,722
"酸黄瓜" 该死 就摆在眼前
"A pickle"! Dang it! It was right there.

221
00:07:14,542 --> 00:07:15,292
你好
Hello.

222
00:07:15,292 --> 00:07:16,292
你好 需要帮忙吗
Hi. Can I help you?

223
00:07:16,292 --> 00:07:16,792
是的
Uh, yes.

224
00:07:16,802 --> 00:07:18,252
我有一个很特殊的东西
Um, I have something pretty special

225
00:07:18,252 --> 00:07:19,861
对我来说意义重大
that means the world to me,

226
00:07:19,871 --> 00:07:20,751
但我愿意卖掉它
yet I gladly part with it

227
00:07:20,751 --> 00:07:22,511
为了证明我对我未婚夫的爱
to prove my love for my fiance

228
00:07:22,511 --> 00:07:24,181
-小卡 你不用 -我要这样做
- Cam, you don't have to... - I do.

229
00:07:24,751 --> 00:07:26,731
这个皮带扣以前的主人是
This is a belt buckle that was once owned

230
00:07:26,731 --> 00:07:29,271
传奇的怀亚特·厄普
by the legendary Wyatt Earp.

231
00:07:29,501 --> 00:07:31,281
当我祖父把这个给我时 愿他安息
And when my grandfather gave it to me, and rest his soul,

232
00:07:31,281 --> 00:07:34,670
他说 孩子 今年...
he said”son, this year is a

233
00:07:35,480 --> 00:07:36,380
你还好吗
Are you ok?

234
00:07:37,350 --> 00:07:38,960
我做不到 你来吧
I can't be here for this. You do it.

235
00:07:38,960 --> 00:07:40,890
顺便再问问那盏灯卖多少钱
And get a price on that divine lamp.

236
00:07:42,690 --> 00:07:43,790
不管怎么样
Um, anyway...

237
00:07:43,790 --> 00:07:45,069
我不想当面打击
Look, I didn't want to say anything

238
00:07:45,069 --> 00:07:45,849
你的未婚夫
in front of your fiance

239
00:07:45,849 --> 00:07:47,269
但这只是个60年代时
but this is a cheap replica

240
00:07:47,269 --> 00:07:49,579
加油站连锁店卖的廉价复制品
given away by a gas-station chain in the '60s.

241
00:07:49,579 --> 00:07:51,409
市面上有一大堆
There's tons of them out there.

242
00:07:51,409 --> 00:07:52,569
也就值20块
It's worth about 20 bucks.

243
00:07:52,569 --> 00:07:53,759
你确定吗
Are you sure?

244
00:07:56,299 --> 00:07:57,228
非常确定
Pretty sure.

245
00:07:58,678 --> 00:08:00,338
他家的确喜欢夸张[打扮]故事
That family loves to dress up a story.

246
00:08:00,718 --> 00:08:01,778
还有打扮小猪
And a pig.

247
00:08:02,008 --> 00:08:03,758
那基本全新的初版第三期
Well, how about a first-edition number 3

248
00:08:03,758 --> 00:08:07,108
《蜘蛛侠大战章鱼博士》能卖多少钱
"Spider-man versus doctor octopus" in near-mint condition?

249
00:08:08,828 --> 00:08:09,987
继续说
Keep talking.

250
00:08:10,107 --> 00:08:10,997
其实
That...

251
00:08:11,937 --> 00:08:13,427
其实这就是全部了
Uh, uh, that's pretty much it.

252
00:08:16,347 --> 00:08:17,697
她怎么还没打来
Why isn't she calling?

253
00:08:17,857 --> 00:08:19,557
你总是对事情抱着怀疑态度
Aren't you the doubter?

254
00:08:19,777 --> 00:08:21,737
她会打来 倒数三
She'll call in three...

255
00:08:22,426 --> 00:08:24,126
二
two-o-o-o...

256
00:08:24,126 --> 00:08:25,826
一 该数一了
One! One's next!

257
00:08:25,826 --> 00:08:26,746
我知道
Yeah.

258
00:08:26,766 --> 00:08:28,866
开始录音
Press record.

259
00:08:30,816 --> 00:08:31,716
喂 妈妈
Hi, mom.

260
00:08:31,726 --> 00:08:32,876
海莉 宝贝
Haley, honey,

261
00:08:32,876 --> 00:08:34,565
你是想发这条短信给你爸爸吧
did you mean to send this text to your dad?

262
00:08:34,565 --> 00:08:36,215
短信 什么短信
Text? What does it say?

263
00:08:37,685 --> 00:08:40,005
"抱歉打扰你打高尔夫 但是..."
"I hate to spoil your golf game, but..."

264
00:08:40,815 --> 00:08:43,185
不是 我没发那条短信
Uh, no, no. I-I didn't send that.

265
00:08:43,185 --> 00:08:44,695
肯定是你和爸爸说话时
Must have accidentally dictated

266
00:08:44,695 --> 00:08:46,205
手机不小心听写了
when you and dad were talking.

267
00:08:46,205 --> 00:08:47,634
好吧 奇怪了
Okay. That's weird.

268
00:08:47,634 --> 00:08:48,994
正好我打给你了
Well, while I have you on the phone,

269
00:08:48,994 --> 00:08:50,864
你能把刷碗机里的餐具拿出来
would you mind emptying the dishwasher and doing --

270
00:08:50,864 --> 00:08:52,094
你那边的信号弱了
Oh, you're breaking up.

271
00:08:52,214 --> 00:08:53,164
海莉 能听见我说话吗
Haley, can you hear me now?

272
00:08:53,164 --> 00:08:54,304
听不见了 再见
Nope. Bye.

273
00:08:54,434 --> 00:08:56,304
-大功告成 -跟你说了没问题吧
- Got it. - Told you we'd get it.

274
00:08:56,304 --> 00:08:58,364
只需创造性地剪辑一下
Now just for a little creative editing...

275
00:08:59,993 --> 00:09:01,713
你那么聪明
Your mind is so brilliant.

276
00:09:01,713 --> 00:09:03,353
如果你把这份聪明用到学习上的话
If you put this much effort into your schoolwork,

277
00:09:03,353 --> 00:09:04,683
你一定能成就...
there is no telling the things you could --

278
00:09:04,693 --> 00:09:06,393
你为什么总是那么扫兴
Why do you have to ruin everything?

279
00:09:06,393 --> 00:09:08,803
是啊 她总是在说我的"潜力"
I know, she's always talking about my potential.

280
00:09:13,152 --> 00:09:14,242
当心
Fore!

281
00:09:15,422 --> 00:09:16,212
你觉得我打到她了吗
Do you think I hit her?

282
00:09:16,212 --> 00:09:17,452
没有 她没事
Nah, she's fine.

283
00:09:18,862 --> 00:09:20,632
对不起 我今天太分心了
Sorry I'm so distracted today.

284
00:09:20,672 --> 00:09:21,722
怎么了 哥们
What's wrong, buddy?

285
00:09:23,202 --> 00:09:24,511
我问你件事
Let me ask you something.

286
00:09:24,511 --> 00:09:25,841
你会不会有时候觉得
Do -- do you ever get the sense

287
00:09:25,841 --> 00:09:27,661
你配不上你妻子
that your wife feels like she could have done better?

288
00:09:27,661 --> 00:09:30,201
天呐 不会 她找到我算是三生有幸
God, no. Nah, she's the luckiest woman on earth.

289
00:09:30,201 --> 00:09:31,721
非要说的话 是她配不上我
I mean, if anything, I could've done better.

290
00:09:31,731 --> 00:09:33,841
那女人夜里发出的噪音
The noises that come out of that woman at night?

291
00:09:33,841 --> 00:09:36,311
就好像她是《警察学校》里的那个黑人
It's like she's that black guy from "Police Academy."

292
00:09:36,311 --> 00:09:37,610
说曹操 曹操就到
Oh, speak of the devil.

293
00:09:37,610 --> 00:09:38,390
我老婆发来的信息
Message from my wife,

294
00:09:38,390 --> 00:09:39,930
不是《警察学校》里的那个黑人
not the black guy from "Police Academy."

295
00:09:39,940 --> 00:09:41,190
要真是他发的才给力呢
Oh, that'd be so awesome.

296
00:09:41,190 --> 00:09:42,320
超给力的
That would be neat.

297
00:09:42,450 --> 00:09:43,280
菲尔 我是克莱尔
Phil? Hey, it's Claire.

298
00:09:43,280 --> 00:09:46,140
抱歉打扰你打高尔夫球 但是...
Um, I hate to spoil your golf game, but...

299
00:09:46,140 --> 00:09:46,810
我怀孕了
I'm pregnant!

300
00:09:46,810 --> 00:09:47,400
什么
What?

301
00:09:47,400 --> 00:09:48,840
我们尽快谈谈吧
Let's talk as soon as you can.

302
00:09:50,279 --> 00:09:51,289
我得走了
I have to leave.

303
00:09:51,289 --> 00:09:52,889
什么 我们正在打比赛呢
What? We're in the middle of a game.

304
00:09:52,889 --> 00:09:54,239
我得去找克莱尔
I have to be with Claire!

305
00:09:54,389 --> 00:09:55,559
我的球杆
Oh -- my clubs!

306
00:09:58,039 --> 00:09:59,039
我的帽子
My hat!

307
00:10:01,119 --> 00:10:02,378
我的三明治
My sandwich!

308
00:10:08,518 --> 00:10:09,698
对不起我在里面崩溃了
I'm sorry I freaked out in there.

309
00:10:09,698 --> 00:10:11,038
我们卖了多少钱
How -- how much did we get for it?

310
00:10:11,038 --> 00:10:13,308
给你 我做不到
You know, here. I couldn't do it.

311
00:10:13,308 --> 00:10:14,217
什么 不是吧
What? No.

312
00:10:14,217 --> 00:10:15,887
这个皮带扣对你来说意义重大
This belt buckle means so much to you.

313
00:10:15,887 --> 00:10:18,557
我决定...还是把我的漫画卖了
I'm just gonna -- I am going to sell my comic book instead.

314
00:10:18,557 --> 00:10:20,507
米奇尔 你真是太贴心了
Oh, Mitchell, that is so sweet. You know --

315
00:10:20,747 --> 00:10:23,247
一想到我要跟我爷爷与怀亚特·厄普
The idea of me parting ways with a belt buckle

316
00:10:23,247 --> 00:10:26,416
掰手腕赢来的皮带扣说再见
that my grandfather arm-wrestled Wyatt Earp for --

317
00:10:26,426 --> 00:10:27,916
他掰手腕赢了他吗
He arm-wrestled him?

318
00:10:27,916 --> 00:10:29,586
是啊 但不是为了争个胜负那种
Oh, yeah, but not in a contentious way.

319
00:10:29,596 --> 00:10:30,756
要知道他们是朋友
You know, they were friends.

320
00:10:30,756 --> 00:10:32,886
我爷爷在一次火车劫案里救了他
My grandfather saved his life during a train robbery.

321
00:10:32,886 --> 00:10:34,426
火车劫案 太惊人了
A -- a train robbery? That's -- wow.

322
00:10:34,426 --> 00:10:35,826
小卡 这太惊人了
Cam, wow!

323
00:10:35,826 --> 00:10:37,186
他们关系很铁
They had a real bond.

324
00:10:37,186 --> 00:10:39,845
伟大的怀亚特·厄普和诚实的亚伯·塔克
The great Wyatt Earp and honest Abe Tucker.

325
00:10:41,865 --> 00:10:43,505
我心里知道 不拆穿
I have it, I'll store it,

326
00:10:43,505 --> 00:10:45,155
必要时再拿出来说
and if I need to, I will use it.

327
00:10:48,665 --> 00:10:49,505
这样吧 我放弃
You know what? I quit.

328
00:10:49,505 --> 00:10:51,604
原谅我试图让他开眼界
Pardon me for trying to broaden his horizons.

329
00:10:51,604 --> 00:10:52,944
不 不 你绝对不能放弃
No, no, no. You're not quitting anything.

330
00:10:52,944 --> 00:10:54,054
你得把香肠吃了
You're going to eat your sausage,

331
00:10:54,054 --> 00:10:55,624
而你得把你的酸黄瓜吃了
and you're going to eat your pickle.

332
00:10:55,624 --> 00:10:58,714
我已经受够每天做两种饭了
I am tired of every day cooking two different meals.

333
00:10:58,724 --> 00:11:01,934
不要番茄 只要白肉 多加培根
No tomatoes. White meat only. Extra bacon.

334
00:11:01,934 --> 00:11:03,723
他能多吃培根 凭什么
He gets extra bacon? What the hell?

335
00:11:03,723 --> 00:11:07,003
你们今天必须把这毛病改了
Today is the day you two are stopping this silliness!

336
00:11:07,003 --> 00:11:09,643
我们今天都必须克服一些东西
Fine, we'll all conquer something today.

337
00:11:09,643 --> 00:11:12,143
我有什么好克服的 我什么都吃
What do I have to conquer? I eat everything.

338
00:11:12,803 --> 00:11:14,643
-抚摸斯黛拉的肚子 -什么
- Pet Stella's belly. - What?

339
00:11:14,713 --> 00:11:16,522
你从来不摸斯黛拉的肚子
You won't touch Stella's belly.

340
00:11:16,522 --> 00:11:18,722
因为感觉太奇怪了
Yeah, because it's the creepiest thing ever.

341
00:11:18,722 --> 00:11:20,162
她有三十多个乳头
Has like 30 nipples.

342
00:11:20,172 --> 00:11:21,422
我会把猪血肠吃掉
I'll eat the blood sausage,

343
00:11:21,422 --> 00:11:23,142
曼尼会把酸黄瓜吃掉
Manny eats the pickles,

344
00:11:23,712 --> 00:11:24,912
而你要抚摸她的肚子
you pet her belly.

345
00:11:24,912 --> 00:11:26,152
我宁愿把狗吃了
I'd rather eat the dog.

346
00:11:26,152 --> 00:11:27,762
别做个光说不练的人
Don't be a hypocrite.

347
00:11:28,192 --> 00:11:30,241
要长长的爱抚 发自内心的
Nice and long, like you mean it.

348
00:11:30,241 --> 00:11:32,481
我要看到她舒服得抖腿
I want to see that leg shake.

349
00:11:43,640 --> 00:11:45,160
-我来拿吧 -发生什么事了
- Let me get these! - What's happening?

350
00:11:45,160 --> 00:11:46,920
-我就是太高兴了 -真的吗
- I'm just so happy! - Really?

351
00:11:46,920 --> 00:11:48,320
怎么 你一杆进洞了吗
Oh, did you finally get a hole in one?

352
00:11:48,320 --> 00:11:49,140
一杆进洞
A hole in one.

353
00:11:49,140 --> 00:11:51,340
我希望我们的宝宝也这么幽默
I hope our baby has your sense of humor.

354
00:11:51,340 --> 00:11:53,020
-我们的什么 -我怎么没看出来呢
- Our what? - Why didn't I see it?

355
00:11:53,030 --> 00:11:54,629
去药店 关节肿胀
The drug store, the bloated ankles,

356
00:11:54,629 --> 00:11:55,769
你最近脾气也大了
you've been so moody lately...

357
00:11:55,769 --> 00:11:56,899
你在说什么
What are you talking about?

358
00:11:56,899 --> 00:11:57,729
你看这暴脾气
There it is.

359
00:11:57,729 --> 00:11:59,289
菲尔 我没怀孕
Phil, I am not pregnant.

360
00:11:59,669 --> 00:12:00,559
-你没有吗 -没有
- You're not? - No.

361
00:12:00,559 --> 00:12:01,709
那你怎么跟我留言说怀孕了
Well, why'd you leave me that message?

362
00:12:01,709 --> 00:12:02,649
我没有给你留过言
Didn't leave you a message.

363
00:12:02,649 --> 00:12:04,279
你确定吗 你怀孕时忘性特别大
Are you sure? You're very forgetful when you're pregnant.

364
00:12:04,279 --> 00:12:05,739
我觉得我能记得住
I think I would remember!

365
00:12:05,739 --> 00:12:06,758
那你为什么最近脾气这么大
Then why have you been so moody?

366
00:12:06,758 --> 00:12:09,108
大概是因为你刚刚说我关节肿大
Maybe because you just told me I have giant ankles!

367
00:12:09,108 --> 00:12:11,378
我不希望宝宝听到我们吵架
Shh, I don't want him to hear us fight like this.

368
00:12:11,378 --> 00:12:12,338
把东西给我
Give me this.

369
00:12:15,958 --> 00:12:17,628
这会对大家都有好处
Okay. This is gonna be good for everybody,

370
00:12:17,628 --> 00:12:18,537
所以赶快行动吧
So let's get it over with.

371
00:12:18,537 --> 00:12:19,747
-好吧 -好吧
- Fine. - Okay.

372
00:12:19,747 --> 00:12:21,047
我们数三下
We'll go on the count of three.

373
00:12:21,857 --> 00:12:22,807
一
One...

374
00:12:23,437 --> 00:12:24,317
二
Two...

375
00:12:25,367 --> 00:12:26,277
三
Three.

376
00:12:28,037 --> 00:12:29,177
不
Uh! Oh, no!

377
00:12:29,187 --> 00:12:30,197
我要吐了
I'm gonna throw up!

378
00:12:30,197 --> 00:12:33,066
怎么这么湿 杰 为什么
Why so moist, Jay?! Why?!

379
00:12:35,886 --> 00:12:37,016
我们来的时机不对吗
Is this a bad time?

380
00:12:40,506 --> 00:12:42,186
很抱歉我们来得这么突然
Sorry to barge in here like this.

381
00:12:42,186 --> 00:12:45,475
感觉挺奇怪我还把东西放在这里
I guess it's weird that, uh, I'm still storing stuff here.

382
00:12:45,475 --> 00:12:47,035
我希望你来得再早一点
I just wish you would have come in sooner

383
00:12:47,045 --> 00:12:49,775
在我跟斯黛拉上二垒之前
before I went to second base with Stella.

384
00:12:50,165 --> 00:12:51,545
只需要两分钟
All right, I'll be two minutes.

385
00:12:51,875 --> 00:12:52,885
如果你需要资金来筹备婚礼
If you need money for the wedding,

386
00:12:52,885 --> 00:12:54,505
为什么要把心爱之物卖掉呢
why sell something that you love?

387
00:12:54,505 --> 00:12:55,854
为什么不跟杰开口
Why don't you just ask Jay?

388
00:12:55,854 --> 00:12:56,524
不 不 不 不
No. No. No. No.

389
00:12:56,524 --> 00:12:57,734
为什么不 他是你爸
Why not? He's your father.

390
00:12:57,734 --> 00:12:59,864
跟我爸爸开口要钱让我很不舒服
I don't feel right asking my dad for money, okay?

391
00:12:59,864 --> 00:13:02,784
我成年了 而且我还有我的漫画书
I'm an adult, and I have my comic book.

392
00:13:04,024 --> 00:13:06,324
抱歉打扰你打高尔夫 但是...
I hate to spoil your golf game, but...

393
00:13:06,324 --> 00:13:06,904
我怀孕了
I'm pregnant!

394
00:13:06,904 --> 00:13:08,104
我们尽快谈谈吧
Let's talk as soon as you can.

395
00:13:08,104 --> 00:13:08,833
他们真厉害
Oh, they are good.

396
00:13:08,833 --> 00:13:10,633
简直不敢相信他们能做得这么天衣无缝
I can't believe they pulled such an elaborate stunt.

397
00:13:10,633 --> 00:13:12,483
我不知道是该生气还是该赞赏
I don't know whether to be angry or impressed.

398
00:13:12,483 --> 00:13:13,693
简直太邪恶了
It's so diabolical.

399
00:13:13,693 --> 00:13:14,643
不知道他们从哪里弄到的
I don't know where they get that...

400
00:13:14,653 --> 00:13:15,363
等等 慢着
Wait. Wait. Wait.

401
00:13:15,463 --> 00:13:17,463
我们可以好好捉弄一下他们
We could really have some fun with this.

402
00:13:19,403 --> 00:13:20,023
说来好笑
You know, it's funny,

403
00:13:20,023 --> 00:13:22,002
我从来不知道你喜欢漫画书
I never saw you as a comic-book guy.

404
00:13:22,002 --> 00:13:23,722
我不喜欢 我也不知道
Oh, no, I wasn't, but I don't know.

405
00:13:23,732 --> 00:13:24,752
《蜘蛛侠》
Spider-man --

406
00:13:25,122 --> 00:13:26,492
让我产生了共鸣
He -- he spoke to me.

407
00:13:26,492 --> 00:13:28,702
我觉得大概是因为这种
I -- I think it's because it's about this nerdy kid

408
00:13:28,702 --> 00:13:31,082
一个小书呆子有着
who has this special secret side of himself

409
00:13:31,092 --> 00:13:32,852
不可告人的另外一面的感觉
that he can't share with anybody, and --

410
00:13:32,862 --> 00:13:34,571
我一直也都是这么觉得的
And that's how I always felt.

411
00:13:35,291 --> 00:13:37,671
蜘蛛侠让我觉得与众不同没什么不好
Spider-man made me feel like it was okay to be different.

412
00:13:37,671 --> 00:13:40,871
而且他让我在遇到困难时
And...it made me feel tough enough to --

413
00:13:40,871 --> 00:13:42,271
变得足够坚强
to get through the rough times.

414
00:13:42,271 --> 00:13:43,291
米奇尔 这真让人感动
Oh, Mitchell, that's so sweet.

415
00:13:43,301 --> 00:13:43,951
我都不知道是这样的
I didn't know that.

416
00:13:43,951 --> 00:13:45,271
你确定要把它卖了吗
Are you sure you want to sell it?

417
00:13:45,271 --> 00:13:46,260
是的 确定
Yes, yes.

418
00:13:46,270 --> 00:13:48,720
因为 就像蜘蛛侠一样 我勇敢坚强
Because, like Spider-man, I am brave and strong.

419
00:13:49,560 --> 00:13:50,950
-蜘蛛网 蜘蛛网 -米奇尔
- Oh! Spider web! Spider web! - Mitchell.

420
00:13:51,350 --> 00:13:52,360
弄到我嘴里了
It's in my mouth.

421
00:13:52,460 --> 00:13:54,060
-米奇尔 -怎么了 天哪
- Oh, Mitchell! - What?! Oh!

422
00:13:54,060 --> 00:13:56,400
不 不 不
No! No! Oh, no!

423
00:13:58,010 --> 00:13:59,479
得了吧 菲尔
Give me a break, Phil!

424
00:13:59,479 --> 00:14:00,409
你到底想我怎么样
What do you want from me?!

425
00:14:00,409 --> 00:14:01,939
-小声点 -我什么都没说啊
- Shh! - I didn't say anything.

426
00:14:01,939 --> 00:14:03,429
你听说我怀孕的时候
A little compassion when you thought I was pregnant

427
00:14:03,429 --> 00:14:04,689
能不能多点热情
would have been nice!

428
00:14:05,139 --> 00:14:07,189
对不起 那是我的下意识反应
I'm sorry. It was a knee-jerk reaction.

429
00:14:07,199 --> 00:14:08,859
说你是个混蛋[jerk]倒是真的
You got that half right!

430
00:14:09,219 --> 00:14:11,338
反正你也没怀孕 谁在乎呢
Well, you're not pregnant, anyway, so who cares?!

431
00:14:11,338 --> 00:14:12,998
我说了什么你这么大火气
And what did I say that was so terrible?!

432
00:14:12,998 --> 00:14:15,368
用你的原话说就是
Well, I believe your exact words were,

433
00:14:15,368 --> 00:14:17,768
太好了 我们又有一个孩子可以糟蹋了
"Great, another kid that we could screw up.”

434
00:14:17,858 --> 00:14:20,478
那对不起了 但我们都知道我说得没错
Oh, I'm sorry. But we both know that's true.

435
00:14:20,478 --> 00:14:22,828
等等 你是说我们根本不应该要孩子吗
Wait. Are you saying we never should have them in the first place.

436
00:14:22,828 --> 00:14:24,197
就好像你没这么说过一样
Like you never said that!

437
00:14:24,197 --> 00:14:25,287
这太糟了
This is awful.

438
00:14:25,287 --> 00:14:26,627
你一开始就知道会这样吗
This is what you thought gonna happen?

439
00:14:26,637 --> 00:14:27,917
我想不到那么远的
I didn't think that far ahead.

440
00:14:27,917 --> 00:14:28,947
从没想过 你知道的
I never do. You know that.

441
00:14:28,947 --> 00:14:30,077
你应该阻止我的
You should've stopped me!

442
00:14:30,077 --> 00:14:31,457
你说这会很有趣的
You said this was going to be fun!

443
00:14:31,457 --> 00:14:33,037
现在没有人觉得有趣
Nobody is having fun!

444
00:14:33,037 --> 00:14:34,487
说话注意点 菲尔
Careful?! Please, Phil!

445
00:14:34,487 --> 00:14:35,916
如果你没有把我的肚子搞大
If you hadn't gotten me pregnant,

446
00:14:35,916 --> 00:14:37,156
我根本不可能嫁给你
I never would have married you!

447
00:14:37,156 --> 00:14:38,616
我肯定嫁给鲍比·纳什了
I would have married Bobby Nash!

448
00:14:38,616 --> 00:14:39,876
-真的吗 -是啊
- You would?! - Oh, yeah!

449
00:14:39,876 --> 00:14:43,236
现在我就该在阿斯本一百亩的大庄园里了
And right now, I would be on my 100-acre ranch in Aspen

450
00:14:43,236 --> 00:14:46,006
和我两米多高做对冲基金的老公一起
with my strapping 6'4" hedge-fund husband!

451
00:14:46,006 --> 00:14:47,236
你真的希望你嫁的是鲍比吗
You really wish you'd married Bobby?

452
00:14:47,236 --> 00:14:49,075
每天都这么希望
Oh, every single day!

453
00:14:53,615 --> 00:14:54,685
等等 菲尔
No, Phil.

454
00:14:55,555 --> 00:14:56,405
爸爸 你还好吗
Dad, are you okay?

455
00:14:56,405 --> 00:14:57,325
还行
Yep.

456
00:14:58,005 --> 00:14:59,635
这家里每个人都这么看我
That's what I am to everyone around here.

457
00:14:59,635 --> 00:15:01,044
-妈妈 -只是"还行"而已
- Mom... - Just "Okay."

458
00:15:01,044 --> 00:15:02,064
-菲尔 -妈妈
- Phil! - Hey, mom?

459
00:15:02,064 --> 00:15:03,574
-等会儿 -菲尔
- Not now. - Phil!

460
00:15:04,864 --> 00:15:07,174
你们听见了吗 我们完全骗到他们了
You guys hear that? We totally got them!

461
00:15:08,284 --> 00:15:10,214
快点 我们需要个吹风机
Quick! We need a blow dryer!

462
00:15:10,214 --> 00:15:11,974
是有什么基佬紧急情况吗
Is this some sort of gay emergency?

463
00:15:11,974 --> 00:15:13,503
不 爸爸 不是什么基佬紧急情况
No, dad, it's not a gay emergency!

464
00:15:13,503 --> 00:15:13,993
是我的漫画书
It's my comic book.

465
00:15:13,993 --> 00:15:15,853
我们要... 天呐
We need to -- ohh, god!

466
00:15:15,853 --> 00:15:16,763
全毁了
It's ruined.

467
00:15:16,773 --> 00:15:17,673
米奇尔 没事的
Mitchell, it's okay.

468
00:15:17,673 --> 00:15:19,413
反正也许并不值那么多钱
It probably wasn't worth that much anyway.

469
00:15:19,413 --> 00:15:21,953
这书值五千块 你的皮带扣分文不值
It was worth $5,000! Your belt buckle is garbage.

470
00:15:21,953 --> 00:15:23,043
那是从加油站买的
It came from a gas station!

471
00:15:23,043 --> 00:15:24,903
你祖父从来没见过怀亚特·厄普
Your grandfather never met Wyatt Earp!

472
00:15:25,992 --> 00:15:29,132
这个秘密看来没有保守太久
I didn't hold on to that for quite as long as I thought.

473
00:15:29,552 --> 00:15:30,552
对不起
Hey, I'm sorry.

474
00:15:30,552 --> 00:15:32,912
这事我没想说的
I -- I didn't mean to blurt it out like that.

475
00:15:32,912 --> 00:15:34,182
不 没关系
No, it's -- it's okay.

476
00:15:34,182 --> 00:15:36,642
我也怀疑过时间点不太对
I -- I kinda suspected the dates didn't line up.

477
00:15:36,882 --> 00:15:38,191
现在我开始怀疑那到底是不是
Now I'm starting to think that wasn't

478
00:15:38,191 --> 00:15:39,591
阿梅莉亚·埃尔哈特的指南针了
Amelia Earhart's compass.

479
00:15:40,291 --> 00:15:44,111
太可惜了 但我觉得杰肯定能帮到你们
I'm so sorry, but I am sure that Jay can help you two out.

480
00:15:44,111 --> 00:15:45,261
不 不 不
No, no, no, no, no.

481
00:15:45,261 --> 00:15:46,401
我们想自己解决这个问题
We want to do this on our own.

482
00:15:46,401 --> 00:15:47,881
我能问个问题吗
Can I ask you a question?

483
00:15:48,471 --> 00:15:50,960
你们为什么要弄一个那么大的婚礼
Why are you having such a big thing anyway?

484
00:15:50,960 --> 00:15:53,000
因为我们只结一次婚啊
Well, because we're only getting married once.

485
00:15:53,000 --> 00:15:55,940
我只是想说为什么你们要如此大张旗鼓
I'm just saying, why do you need to make into a spectacle?

486
00:15:55,940 --> 00:15:56,800
大张旗鼓
A s-- a spectacle?

487
00:15:56,800 --> 00:15:59,030
这也许正是老天想要暗示你们
This could be the universe's way of telling you

488
00:15:59,030 --> 00:16:00,440
把婚礼搞得低调一点
to bring it down a notch.

489
00:16:00,440 --> 00:16:02,719
邀请家人 还有你们的朋友胡娇
Invite your family, your friend Pepper,

490
00:16:02,719 --> 00:16:04,889
还有那个叫什么的 爱穿荷叶边的那个
and, what's his name, the -- the -- the flouncy one?

491
00:16:04,889 --> 00:16:05,719
L·大卫
Uh, L'david.

492
00:16:05,719 --> 00:16:08,359
我没有爱穿荷叶边的叫L·大卫的朋友
I don't have a flouncy friend named L'david, dad.

493
00:16:08,359 --> 00:16:10,049
你是说L·迈克或是J·马库斯吗
Do -- do you mean L'michael or J'marcus?

494
00:16:10,049 --> 00:16:11,429
我不太确定你说的是谁
I'm not sure who you're referring to.

495
00:16:11,429 --> 00:16:11,999
管他呢
Whatever.

496
00:16:11,999 --> 00:16:13,669
我就是说低调一点
I'm just saying keep it small.

497
00:16:13,839 --> 00:16:16,558
为何要为了几乎不认识的人花那么多钱呢
Why pay all that money for people you barely know?

498
00:16:16,558 --> 00:16:17,818
你是说你的那些朋友吗
Oh, oh, you mean like any of your friends?

499
00:16:17,818 --> 00:16:20,168
拜托 你不会想邀请我的朋友们的
Oh, please, you don't want any of my friends there.

500
00:16:20,168 --> 00:16:20,948
真的吗 因为我
Really? Because I've --

501
00:16:20,958 --> 00:16:22,658
我管你要名单都要了几个月了
I've been asking for a list for months now.

502
00:16:22,658 --> 00:16:24,278
到底是谁不想让他们来呢
So, so who doesn't want them there --

503
00:16:24,278 --> 00:16:25,588
我还是你
me or you?

504
00:16:25,588 --> 00:16:26,688
你为什么生气
Why are you getting upset?

505
00:16:26,698 --> 00:16:28,637
因为如果这是克莱尔的婚礼
Because, dad, if -- if this was Claire's wedding,

506
00:16:28,637 --> 00:16:29,677
你就会投入得多了
you would be all over it.

507
00:16:29,677 --> 00:16:31,467
你甚至会要求在你的俱乐部办
You'd be wanting to have it at your club.

508
00:16:31,467 --> 00:16:32,677
你会邀请你所有的朋友
You'd be inviting all your friends.

509
00:16:32,677 --> 00:16:33,417
拜托
Oh, please!

510
00:16:33,417 --> 00:16:35,747
克莱尔结婚时我也一样不那么兴奋
I wasn't that thrilled when Claire got married, either.

511
00:16:35,747 --> 00:16:38,087
"也一样" 老天爷啊 别说了
"Either"? For god's sake, just stop talking.

512
00:16:38,087 --> 00:16:39,517
所有人都退一步
Everybody back off.

513
00:16:39,557 --> 00:16:40,816
我不觉得我说得过分
I don't think I'm out of line

514
00:16:40,816 --> 00:16:42,866
我的朋友不会想在盛大的
suggesting my friends don't want to see

515
00:16:42,866 --> 00:16:44,756
同志婚礼上 看父子共舞
a father-son dance at a big gay wedding.

516
00:16:44,756 --> 00:16:46,916
根本没什么父子舞 老爸
There is no father-son dance, dad.

517
00:16:46,926 --> 00:16:48,066
我不知道在同志婚礼上是什么情况
I don't know what things go on there.

518
00:16:48,066 --> 00:16:49,516
我需要牵着你走红毯吗
Do I walk you down the aisle?

519
00:16:49,516 --> 00:16:51,066
会有人扔花束吗
Does someone throw a bouquet?

520
00:16:51,066 --> 00:16:52,076
我是说 我不知道
I mean, I'm just saying, I don't know

521
00:16:52,076 --> 00:16:53,435
如果我俱乐部那些朋友来了
how this stuff plays out

522
00:16:53,435 --> 00:16:54,625
会是怎样的情况
with my guys from the club.

523
00:16:54,625 --> 00:16:56,205
你是说那些围坐在屋子里
Oh, you mean the guys who sit around the locker room

524
00:16:56,205 --> 00:16:57,495
裸身看橄榄球赛的人吗
watching football naked?

525
00:16:57,495 --> 00:16:59,435
不 别劝我 问题不在于他们
No! No! See, this -- this isn't about them.

526
00:16:59,435 --> 00:17:00,415
而在于你
This is about you.

527
00:17:00,415 --> 00:17:02,075
是你觉得有点不太能接受
You are the one that's uncomfortable here.

528
00:17:02,075 --> 00:17:02,775
好吧 我承认
Fine. I admit it.

529
00:17:02,775 --> 00:17:04,695
你们的整个婚礼在我看来都很古怪
This whole wedding thing is weird to me.

530
00:17:05,724 --> 00:17:07,174
为什么你可以做真实的自己
Now, see, why do you get to be you,

531
00:17:07,174 --> 00:17:08,584
而我却不可以呢
but I don't get to be me?

532
00:17:08,594 --> 00:17:10,334
我也不想对此感到不太能接受
See, I didn't choose to be uncomfortable.

533
00:17:10,334 --> 00:17:11,304
但我生来就是这样的人
I was born this way.

534
00:17:11,304 --> 00:17:13,704
你现在真的要用同志圣歌来堵我们的嘴吗
Are you really throwing a gay anthem in our face right now?

535
00:17:13,704 --> 00:17:14,874
该死的 你也理解一下我吧
Oh, damn it. Give me some credit.

536
00:17:14,874 --> 00:17:16,424
你知道我做到今天这样有多不容易
You know how far I've come.

537
00:17:16,424 --> 00:17:18,883
你还希望我怎么样呢
I mean, what more do you want from me?

538
00:17:18,883 --> 00:17:20,183
算了 老爸 你可以的
You know what, dad? Y-you do.

539
00:17:20,183 --> 00:17:21,213
你也可以做真实的自己
You do get to be you.

540
00:17:21,293 --> 00:17:23,403
如果你真的不太能完全接受的话 那么
If -- if it really makes you that uncomfortable, then...

541
00:17:24,473 --> 00:17:25,823
就别来参加我们的婚礼了
don't come to the wedding.

542
00:17:27,013 --> 00:17:27,513
米奇尔
Mitchell...

543
00:17:27,523 --> 00:17:29,693
别 瞧 我们已经在削减参与人员了
No! No, see? We're scaling back already.

544
00:17:35,272 --> 00:17:36,672
菲尔 亲爱的
Phil, honey...

545
00:17:37,522 --> 00:17:38,442
刚刚在下面是怎么回事
What happened down there?

546
00:17:38,442 --> 00:17:39,352
你攻击了我
You attacked me.

547
00:17:39,362 --> 00:17:41,452
那是在玩啊 我们都在互相攻击啊
In a fun way. We were both doing it.

548
00:17:42,082 --> 00:17:43,411
我听到你今早说的话了
I heard you this morning,

549
00:17:43,521 --> 00:17:45,471
谈论你超帅的男友鲍比
Talking about your super-cute boyfriend Bobby,

550
00:17:45,481 --> 00:17:46,941
说我只是个"舒适的"选择
saying that I was the "Comfortable" choice,

551
00:17:46,951 --> 00:17:48,751
你跟我结婚只是为了跟你爸作对
that you only married me because your dad hated it.

552
00:17:48,751 --> 00:17:49,791
不 亲爱的
No, sweetheart.

553
00:17:49,791 --> 00:17:51,481
我当时不是在说你
I was not talking about you.

554
00:17:51,481 --> 00:17:53,601
我是在跟女儿们解释
I was explaining to the girls

555
00:17:53,611 --> 00:17:56,760
我有张照片上穿的那身衣服
about an outfit that I was wearing in a picture

556
00:17:56,770 --> 00:17:58,620
是个"舒适的"选择
that was the comfortable choice

557
00:17:58,620 --> 00:18:01,090
而我爸很讨厌这件衣服
that my dad hated.

558
00:18:01,090 --> 00:18:01,760
亲爱的
Oh, honey.

559
00:18:01,760 --> 00:18:04,070
你怎会以为我是因为那样才跟你结婚的呢
You can't possibly think that's why I married you.

560
00:18:04,070 --> 00:18:06,000
好吧 我懂你爸这人
Okay, I -- I get it a-about your dad.

561
00:18:06,000 --> 00:18:08,539
但有时候我真的会假想
I -- I -- sometimes I do wonder, you know,

562
00:18:08,539 --> 00:18:10,089
如果你当时没怀孕
if you hadn't gotten pregnant...

563
00:18:10,259 --> 00:18:11,759
-我们会像现在这样在一起吗 -是啊
- would we even be here right now? - Yeah.

564
00:18:11,759 --> 00:18:13,829
我也老是想同样的问题
Well, I wonder the same thing, too.

565
00:18:14,569 --> 00:18:15,069
是吗
You do?

566
00:18:15,069 --> 00:18:16,709
是啊 经常想
Yes. All the time.

567
00:18:16,709 --> 00:18:17,789
就上周
Just last week,

568
00:18:17,789 --> 00:18:20,868
你和孩子们在外面洗车
you and the kids were outside washing the car,

569
00:18:20,868 --> 00:18:22,708
你们开始了肥皂泡大战
and you got in that soap battle

570
00:18:22,708 --> 00:18:25,518
大家都在跑 不停地笑
and everybody was running around laughing.

571
00:18:25,628 --> 00:18:28,478
我站在厨房的窗前
And I stood there at the kitchen window,

572
00:18:29,308 --> 00:18:31,918
心想着我是多么幸运
and I was thinking how lucky I am.

573
00:18:32,477 --> 00:18:34,007
因为如果我没跟你结婚的话
'cause I would have missed all of this

574
00:18:34,007 --> 00:18:35,367
就会错过这一切
if I hadn't married you.

575
00:18:35,577 --> 00:18:36,237
我知道你在看
I knew you were watching.

576
00:18:36,237 --> 00:18:37,907
所以我故意把海绵掉在了地上
That's why I dropped the sponge.

577
00:18:39,047 --> 00:18:41,037
正是这个动作最开始吸引了我的注意力
That's what got my attention in the first place.

578
00:18:41,127 --> 00:18:43,347
你真的不后悔没嫁给鲍比·纳什吗
You really don't regret not marrying Bobby Nash?

579
00:18:43,347 --> 00:18:44,007
不后悔
No.

580
00:18:44,017 --> 00:18:45,806
他是很帅 但也很无趣
He was cute, but he was boring.

581
00:18:45,806 --> 00:18:47,606
他都没成功逗笑过我一次
He never once made me laugh.

582
00:18:47,606 --> 00:18:49,146
我经常能逗得你笑
You laugh at me all the time.

583
00:18:49,566 --> 00:18:50,616
是啊
I do.

584
00:18:53,176 --> 00:18:54,606
我很喜欢你听说我怀孕时
I liked how happy you were

585
00:18:54,606 --> 00:18:55,656
表现出的那种喜悦
when you thought I was pregnant.

586
00:18:56,296 --> 00:18:57,485
那是当然了
Of course I was.

587
00:19:04,185 --> 00:19:05,935
你可以帮我捡起来吗
Do you think you could pick that up for me?

588
00:19:06,385 --> 00:19:07,435
不知道呢
I don't know.

589
00:19:08,825 --> 00:19:10,514
真的好低哦
It's so far down here.

590
00:19:12,294 --> 00:19:14,114
瞧吧 我就说他们肯定会和好的
See? I told you they were gonna be fine.

591
00:19:16,454 --> 00:19:17,504
-锁门了 -快跑
- Door lock! - Run!

592
00:19:17,504 --> 00:19:19,054
快走 快走
Go! Go! Go! Go!

593
00:19:21,464 --> 00:19:23,943
嗨菲尔 我是米奇尔 克莱尔的弟弟
Hey, Phil, it's Mitchell, Claire's brother.

594
00:19:24,063 --> 00:19:27,233
我听说你把克莱尔搞怀孕了
I heard about your and Claire's whole pregnancy situation,

595
00:19:27,243 --> 00:19:30,373
我很抱歉我爸的反应那么恶劣
And I'm -- I'm sorry my dad didn't have a better reaction.

596
00:19:31,033 --> 00:19:32,153
你别往心里去
Don't take it personally.

597
00:19:32,153 --> 00:19:33,263
他就是那样的人
He's just like that.

598
00:19:33,273 --> 00:19:34,352
他会想通的
He'll -- he'll come around.

599
00:19:34,352 --> 00:19:35,392
如果他想不通的话
And if not...

600
00:19:37,582 --> 00:19:38,712
那也是他的损失
His loss.

601
00:19:39,672 --> 00:19:40,532
对了 总之
Yeah, okay, anyway,

602
00:19:40,532 --> 00:19:42,402
既然我们已经是一家人了
uh, now that we're gonna be family,

603
00:19:42,402 --> 00:19:44,542
我如果和你表妹谈恋爱的话可能有点怪
it's -- it's probably a little weird for me to date your cousin,

604
00:19:44,542 --> 00:19:48,481
或许你可以让她别再呼我了
so maybe you could ask her to stop paging me?

605
00:19:50,351 --> 00:19:51,221
真是太疯狂了
It's so crazy.

606
00:19:51,221 --> 00:19:53,901
我也觉得 戴着呼机的米奇尔舅舅
I know. Uncle Mitchell with a pager.

607
00:19:59,810 --> 00:20:01,680
不行 斯黛拉 别妄想了
No, Stella. Okay? No!

608
00:20:09,500 --> 00:20:11,190
斯黛拉 我说了不行
Stella, I said no.

609
00:20:16,959 --> 00:20:17,879
你...
You...

610
00:20:19,159 --> 00:20:21,069
好吧 就这一次
Okay, but just this time, okay?

611
00:20:21,609 --> 00:20:23,509
你最好死守这个秘密
And you keep your mouth shut about this.

612
00:20:29,908 --> 00:20:30,858
是谁鬼鬼祟祟的
Who's there?
